{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Noticed that the AI voice solutions have gone quiet lately. Not because they’re so successful and companies are actively using them. The opposite.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb:u000001"}], "text": "AI voice solutions have gone quiet in the real estate industry, not because of their success but the opposite."}, "title": "AI voice solutions in real estate", "topic": "AI solutions in PropTech"}, "content_hash": "2c3c26b0c226b2526efb90b8744fad94d91d7fc2f98d7ed319612f77d879a940", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb:knowledge:d52a976ae1243720", "metadata_hash": "89cd0347cfd42201b65c06be22255b2619f98a4c668c65dcb69bd274afcee522", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-27T07:27:49.356000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "2a338f85c53f64f665739482967cd6782068edd43bfd9a47c7002f3fb31a9dff", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_for-all-the-proptech-founders-out-there-who-activity-7498642413242978304-gez1", "title": "AI voice solutions in real estate", "topic": "AI solutions in PropTech", "topic_slug": "ai-solutions-in-proptech"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "It’s because they don’t understand it on a deeper level, and that’s why - don’t actually have a product - that solves a problem that people are ready to Pay for.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb:u000002"}], "text": "PropTech startups often fail because they lack a deep understanding of the market and do not have a product that solves a problem people are ready to pay for."}, "title": "Common startup pitfalls", "topic": "PropTech startup pitfalls"}, "content_hash": "2c3c26b0c226b2526efb90b8744fad94d91d7fc2f98d7ed319612f77d879a940", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb:knowledge:02442a124a94d4cb", "metadata_hash": "89cd0347cfd42201b65c06be22255b2619f98a4c668c65dcb69bd274afcee522", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-27T07:27:49.356000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "2a338f85c53f64f665739482967cd6782068edd43bfd9a47c7002f3fb31a9dff", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-27-for-all-the-proptech-founders-md-ccfe6604fb", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_for-all-the-proptech-founders-out-there-who-activity-7498642413242978304-gez1", "title": "Common startup pitfalls", "topic": "PropTech startup pitfalls", "topic_slug": "proptech-startup-pitfalls"}
